    "detailed_description": "\u2018Match, Talk, Date!\u2019 is a modern take on the classic dating sim genre, where you use a dating app to chat to a diverse cast of unique characters and eventually ask them to go out on a date with you! Play how you want and date who you want, both men and women are available! <br><br>Can you convince them to go out on a date with you, or are you going home alone?<br><br><strong>Wishlist now!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/61c9692c39162d5397ea4bc8e4a3ae01.webp?t=1740688681\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/36d7a9dd70b497b2605c632e9e4e933b.webp?t=1740688681\" /></div><br><strong>Customize your dating profile and receive matches from your potential dating partners.</strong> The game will use this information to customize conversations to your preferences!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/a2c2c5bf1837fdecacbee1baa7efdaee.poster.avif?t=1740688681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/a2c2c5bf1837fdecacbee1baa7efdaee.webm?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/a2c2c5bf1837fdecacbee1baa7efdaee.mp4?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/9b645eb0a86086cbcd0bb745ef749e24.webp?t=1740688681\" /></div><br>Have meaningful conversations where you get to know the person behind the dating profile.<br><br><strong>You decide what chat messages to send and how the conversation goes.</strong> But be wary, the entire conversation will change not only depending on what you say, but also what you said in the past and the current situation!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/bf055097750cecd11d66ae0577ebc500.poster.avif?t=1740688681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/bf055097750cecd11d66ae0577ebc500.webm?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/bf055097750cecd11d66ae0577ebc500.mp4?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/a8a7ee287e9750b92a1e005ecc007670.webp?t=1740688681\" /></div><br><strong>Prepare a gift, pick the perfect outfit and select the ideal location all to create the perfect date for your partner!</strong><br>But that\u2019s just the first step\u2026 because this time you don't have endless time to think about what to say!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/759856b4159ea81cbf385b55e9e3015a.poster.avif?t=1740688681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/759856b4159ea81cbf385b55e9e3015a.webm?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/759856b4159ea81cbf385b55e9e3015a.mp4?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/ad2f42eb28691370526c86eaa05e7e1f.webp?t=1740688681\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/87802c2e50838f0e9c540023bb970e90.poster.avif?t=1740688681\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/87802c2e50838f0e9c540023bb970e90.webm?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/87802c2e50838f0e9c540023bb970e90.mp4?t=1740688681\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/61c9692c39162d5397ea4bc8e4a3ae01.webp?t=1740688681\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482660/extras/ae1a9c6207a7ea369a3e34cbe1268c96.webp?t=1740688681\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  \u2764 Talk to a diverse cast of characters each with their own personality!<br></li><li>  \u2764 Date who you want. Men, women, both? There is something for everyone!<br></li><li>  \u2764 Extensive conversation system that shapes itself to the player and situation.<br></li><li>  \u2764 Create and shape your own characters with the character creation tools.<br></li><li>  \u2764 Bonus minigames. Everyone likes minigames right?<br></li><li>  \u2764 Customize your virtual phone. Cute stickers and more!<br></li><li>  \u2764 Optional nudity! Play how you want.</li></ul>",
